{"id": 94019, "field": "description", "ja": "クマ(Bear)に休憩を取るように\n命令します。クマは時間の経過と\n共に、少し幸福度を回復します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2703"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "グースカピー。。。"}}
